<title>Pakistan and Afghanistan: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/afghanistan-pakistan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-afghanistan-pakistan-2026-11-26T22:28:49.536Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 22:28:49 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Security forces in Balochistan killed twelve India-sponsored terrorists, while separate encounters in Punjab left three people dead. A gas cylinder blast in Dera Ismail Khan killed two cousins, and a bomber struck a compound housing foreigners in Afghanistan. Pakistani forces clashed with a Taliban fighter in Khyber Pakhtunkhwa, resulting in the fighter's death, and the Taliban was blamed for torching a girls school in Afghanistan. Pakistan condemned a Houthi militia attack on a Riyadh financial district tower and its special representative discussed Afghan terrorist groups with Dutch officials. The conflict produced 1,794 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE9tNERPS1Fpc1RQU19kRGh3NnN0ZDRna1BqRTY4bEoyRDJkTmhjTnFMZC1CS3NBQVhIeW1tdzV0MEZRU3djakdMSlV6TGNXSmFnV3h2Qmx0Nkt1SGkwT3c?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxNTEtyX3VHdW9ndUk5VDFCYUIzUk8xMkF2eWozLWdTTnUwUkNPWnNUVElPMXRrWlJ0bFh6bktjNXpKRFIzcmxiMUF2bVJKbjZJbVFkOG05MFRIaHE1UmoxcTZobjFFR2JUT08zVTJ3ZDd0U2ZreEJSUEY1dTFLQlQtT0RzRHFORW4xbVhoWF9jb2dSV3duWXBsY2U0cEptQVBqRHRuLTRUdW11QkUwQ2xVa0pOb3JNS0hQNUpndFhB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMif0FVX3lxTE12ckFfYU9vNnV3Q0RuNjdXcUoxR1V3MkFpcU5YYzNVdGRTZXRDRERfMEMxWEZHSWg5M1ZYbk9OZlhHbkJFNnN0d05WV09ub0hWdG1Ta2l3S3daS1ptTHFQRFE1RDhvcE5fVzRDcXlCMzlzcm50VWR4SmlpX2tNRnM?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE8waDYxY2RoMUZqN1RvT19XN0tqTDN0ZzVKRHRERDFsZm1PTkY5Z1Z5Q3Zvb2ZfVG5CNFZLRWo3MDE2a09vZVFDdA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxQcEw4WVpkQnJYVzJ3b0p0OGwxcnVzYmhOdlBZMFB3bURzZXFLRjJ1OW5NZzU0bjNxd3NSdnQ5dlpxLW5